 drag, ctrl click/drag, etc\n-- nothing is painted.\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[tilemaplayer-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18812872/tilemaplayer-bug.zip)\n\nit feels a bit silly to include such a basic example (its literally just a TileMapLayer and one tile) but I swear this isn't working for me at all.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102906/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102906/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}